            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Religious developments and changes in VU-students ( students at the Free University of Amsterdam ), originating from protestant and catholic families. Role of religion and church in parental home / religious socialization in the family / atmosphere at home / relationship between parents and respondent, before as well as nowadays / participation of parents and friends in church and religion, before as well as nowadays / religious education at primary school, secondary school and at the university / newspapers which are read before as well as nowadays. Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ occupation/employment/ education/ readership, mass media, and 'cultural' exposure</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
